%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4fafe43b89343e3a7ba1235e8987c0f, type: 3}
  m_Name: PreBounty1_2_BountyBoardDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Entries:
  - content: "You\u2019ve been standing there for quite some time, kid."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7570221363656654914
    - rid: 7570221363656654915
    - rid: 7570221363656654917
    - rid: 7570221363656654922
  - content: Ives. How long have you been here?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095657258319962
  - content: "Long enough. Thought I\u2019d give you some space."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Then you've seen already? They\u2019re finally reopening the Tundra."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7570221363656654928
  - content: They kept telling me it was too contaminated to traverse. What changed?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Cam made a breakthrough. He\u2019s been burning the midnight oil to
      get approval for his \u201Csafe\u201D Wasteland traversing invention. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095657258319948
    - rid: 314095657258319963
  - content: 'You''re saying that he''s invented something that can help us cross
      the Tundra safely? '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7570221363656654923
  - content: "Yep. I\u2019ll be taking the first team out. Now\u2019s finally our
      chance to find out what happened during Ailin\u2019s \u2019business trip\u2019. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 7570221363656654929
  - content: "I\u2019m coming with you."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095657258319945
    - rid: 314095657258319966
  - content: 'Ofcourse, you and Cam are the first ones on the list. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095657258319946
    - rid: 314095657258319965
  - content: Thanks, you're the best Ives.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095657258319944
    - rid: 314095657258319967
    - rid: 7570221363656654930
    - rid: 7570221363656654931
    - rid: 7570221363656654932
  - content: 'Go grab him for me will you? Kiddo''s always late unless you drag him
      out of his lab. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095657258319942
    - rid: 314095657258319969
  - content: Yeah, I will.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "We\u2019re gonna find out what happened out there, kid. I promise."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095657258319940
    - rid: 314095657258319971
  - content: The mentor and mentee bump fists, a conduit of resolve.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095657258319939
    - rid: 7570221363656654918
    - rid: 7570221363656654919
    - rid: 7570221363656654920
    - rid: 7570221363656654921
